{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "163", "x": 0.8953504215774838, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.03839282702615196, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Colin: Same in my area. We could include something about developing disused", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.12319506908974809, "w": 0.8260235860706727, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "industrial sites. It seems like a good idea because you're not doing any harm to the", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.15152541916388573, "w": 0.8265242154201017, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "natural environment.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.17970752416545568, "w": 0.22645850205096044, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Rosie: Yeah, but aren't the buildings architecturally significant?", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2080378742395933, "w": 0.6613339080882243, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Colin: Not really. And what people forget is that they often used quite dangerous", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.23636822431373095, "w": 0.8262446298710759, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "materials, chemicals and things which haven't been properly cleared away. So, the", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.26469857438786853, "w": 0.82641584654393, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "whole site has to be made safe.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2930660423122369, "w": 0.33329183635828086, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Rosie: That can't be cheap. And I bet it's often not budgeted for.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.32154476948381594, "w": 0.6647605996192428, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Colin: You're right.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.35180336170032345, "w": 0.20489027625656378, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Rosie: Have you read about Masdar City in Abu Dhabi?", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.38206195391683095, "w": 0.566544513310456, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Colin: Yes. It was designed to be a green city, wasn't it? That might be a good", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.41232058385473097, "w": 0.8261490766141298, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "example of a city which set out to depend entirely on renewable energy.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.43278964484403637, "w": 0.7463973756482525, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Rosie: Yes, we should say something about that. It was designed to be totally", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4630482747819364, "w": 0.8261637376825239, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "pedestrianized too, wasn't it? With the transport underground.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4833937227679837, "w": 0.6466191166183415, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Colin: Yes. And they had big plans for recycling to reduce waste to the lowest", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5136523527058837, "w": 0.8259642241224198, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "possible level. But let's stick to talking about power sources.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5339730931798364, "w": 0.6300901973533594, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Rosie: Then there's that eco town in England, Greenhill Abbottz. It set out to", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5643800059116967, "w": 0.8260180497231673, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "conform to the usual principles, sustainability and so on. A lot of people were", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5847007463856493, "w": 0.826137388769396, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "against it at first. They said the plans were unrealistic. I'm not sure how far they've", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.605021486859602, "w": 0.8260988393867654, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "got with it. Um, I'll check.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6254905478489075, "w": 0.26959497927099224, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Colin: Right. So, it looks as if we have a sort of plan and we can work.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.655749140065415, "w": 0.7020514884419006, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Part 4", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6866381321935638, "w": 0.07385097977459479, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Interest in food fashions has risen rapidly since the birth of the smartphone", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7054756675139897, "w": 0.7713041984071108, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "when people first began taking photos of their food and instantly sharing", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7243131273916306, "w": 0.7714568580633262, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "them with their friends. The food industry in the UK in particular is obsessed", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7432989077846242, "w": 0.7713260362222712, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "with finding and exploiting the next big food trend. Marketeers aim to create", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.762136367662265, "w": 0.7717072240005175, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "a huge demand for a food item which was previously unknown or not needed.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7809739029826909, "w": 0.771543594174245, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "One of the most effective ways of promoting a new food product is by using", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7999596833756843, "w": 0.7716744160153, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "social media influencers as brand ambassadors in return for free samples.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8187971432533252, "w": 0.7771975378017194, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Many influencers will post content about a product. Although there are", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8376346031309662, "w": 0.7715220639339461, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "influencers with hundreds of thousands of followers who can command", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8566451287574468, "w": 0.7714565504884647, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "large fees for their services. Companies which sell vegan produce were", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8754825886350877, "w": 0.7714782857786714, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "pioneers in being able to increase sales really quickly in this way. For a food", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8943200485127285, "w": 0.771596189475547, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "item to become really popular, it has to be readily available. So supermarkets", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.9131575083903694, "w": 0.7717395193609661, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "have a role to play in creating a new food trend. They have dedicated teams", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.9321433642261479, "w": 0.7713914471427987, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}